*.xpi
dist
node_modules
__pycache__

# Everything dot-prefixed, at any depth: editor and tool droppings land
# there, and the build/lint tooling writes several multi-megabyte caches
# (.schema-cache, .experiments-cache, .lib-*-cache) that are trivially
# re-downloaded and must never be committed. Opt the few we do track back
# in below - .github has to be un-ignored as a directory, or git will not
# descend into it to find the workflows.
.*
!.gitattributes
!.gitignore
!.npmrc
!.prettierignore
!.github/
# Fork addition: the project's Claude skills ship with the repository, so a
# fresh checkout can be worked on; Claude's local settings in .claude/ stay
# out of it.
!.claude/
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
